<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>This is He whom they in old time</l><l>Chanted of with one accord,</l><l>Whom the voices of the prophets</l><l>Promised in their faithful word;</l><l>Now He shines, the long-expected;</l><l>Let creation praise its Lord,</l><l>Evermore and evermore.</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>O ye heights of heav’n, adore Him;</l><l>Angel hosts, His praises sing;</l><l>All dominions, bow before Him,</l><l>And extol our Lord and King.</l><l>Let no tongue on earth be silent,</l><l>Every voice in concert ring,</l><l>Evermore and evermore.</l></lg>
<lg label="4."><l>Christ, to Thee, with God the Father,</l><l>And, with Holy Ghost, to Thee,</l><l>Hymn and chant and high thanksgiving,</l><l>And unwearied praises be;</l><l>Honor, glory, and dominion,</l><l>And eternal victory,</l><l>Evermore and evermore.</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
